      "en": "“If she has a husband, while her vows are on her, or the rash utterance of her lips with which she has bound her soul,",
      "ko": "또 혹시 남편을 맞을 때에 서원이나 마음을 제어하려는 서약을 경솔히 그 입에서 발하였다 하자",
      "source_text_hash": "89f7545474d2f8d343662dc625eb2bc72782e57992d5b507f468f04b9ee97edc",
      "translation_text_hash": "28af9da22cb118dc31a4c9950091d3d2f57438596fd810cb2d37ab7b5ae9f796",
